{"id":1150201,"chapter_id":1150201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"伊格尼被带进审查室的时候显然情绪不太好，这也很正常。毕竟无论是谁被突然叫进小黑屋这种事，都有生气的充分理由。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1150229},{"step":2,"content":"她的眼神在你手上晃了一下，真是敏锐的观察力——你手上正拿着那份案件的详细报告。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1150229},{"step":3,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你想干嘛？朗诵禁闭者的光荣事迹？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1150229},{"step":4,"content":"你可能是误会了，我只想和你聊聊天。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":5,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"呵……聊天？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1150228},{"step":6,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你可以拒绝回答，但你所说的一切将作为证据呈堂供述——这样的聊天吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1150228},{"step":7,"options":["你误会了"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"drawing":1150228,"choices":[{"text":"你误会了","goto":10}]},{"step":8,"content":"我刚来这里，还没学会你说的那一套。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1150228},{"step":9,"content":"我只是觉得，当年的案件一定另有隐情。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1150228},{"step":10,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"没有隐情。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1150229},{"step":11,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"为什么一件事一定要有隐情？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1150229},{"step":12,"content":"虽然我上任的时间并不长，但也已经接触过很多禁闭者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1150229},{"step":13,"content":"他们会因为自身的能力失控误伤别人，很多情况并不是出于本意，所以我相信那应该也不是你的本意。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1150229},{"step":14,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你想太多了，我就是故意的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1150228},{"step":15,"content":"那你的理由是？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1150228},{"step":16,"content":"伊格尼白了你一眼，歪了歪头，已然是没了耐心。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1150229},{"step":17,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"能有什么理由？因为我是禁闭者。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1150229},{"step":18,"content":"那你为什么要自首？像你这样的禁闭者，和治安官玩捉迷藏不是更好？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1150229},{"step":19,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"自首……你从哪听说的？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1150226},{"step":20,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":21,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":22,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":23,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":24,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":25,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":26,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":27,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":22,"course":6,"drawing":1150226},{"step":28,"content":"FAC的记录档案，总不会出错吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1150226},{"step":29,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你哪来的那么多废话！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1150226},{"step":30,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"呵，什么“只想和你聊聊天”，说得好听，到头来还不是为了从我身上挖消息？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1150226},{"step":31,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你们都是一样的！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1150226},{"step":32,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"卑鄙！虚伪！假惺惺！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1150226},{"step":33,"content":"也许是你的话终于刺激到了伊格尼，她的态度陡然转变，仿佛一只炸了毛的刺猬，开始不断用言语攻击你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1150226},{"step":34,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"一份没头没尾的档案能证明什么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1150226},{"step":35,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我残暴，恐怖，新城的那些人见到我就像见到灾星一样！我就是个十恶不赦的禁闭者！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1150226},{"step":36,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"所以不用再白费心思了，你从我身上得不到任何你想要的东西。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1150226},{"step":37,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"今天的谈话就到此为止吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1150226},{"step":38,"content":"可比起进攻的武器，她那浑身竖起的尖刺倒更像是一种自保的手段。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1150226},{"step":39,"content":"看着伊格尼戒备的眼神和双手抱臂的抗拒姿态，你收回递给她的物证，决定换一种方式。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1150226},{"step":40,"options":["套近乎","拉家常"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"drawing":1150226,"choices":[{"text":"套近乎","goto":36},{"text":"拉家常","goto":42}]},{"step":41,"content":"刚才的问话只是例行公事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1150226},{"step":42,"content":"你放低了音量，尽量缓和自己的态度。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1150226},{"step":43,"content":"<size=25>其实……我这次来，是想请你帮个忙。</size>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1150226},{"step":44,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你干嘛！站回去！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1150227},{"step":45,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我警告你不要耍花招！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1150226},{"step":46,"content":"唉……好吧。只是我初来乍到，对当地有什么美食一无所知，所以就想请新城最有名的美少女美食评论家来帮帮我。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1150226,"next":[45]},{"step":47,"content":"我最近打算请几个要好的同事吃饭。但……我初来乍到，又不清楚新城什么食物有名。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1150226},{"step":48,"content":"所以……就想请新城最有名的美少女美食评论家来推荐点好吃的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1150226},{"step":49,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你……在说什么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1150229,"next":[45]},{"step":50,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":51,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":52,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":53,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":54,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":55,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":56,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":45,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":57,"speaker":"录音","content":"各位吃货早上好，我们又见面啦。今天带大家去试吃一家你们绝对——没有吃过的拉面店。","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1150229},{"step":58,"speaker":"录音","content":"它的位置非常不好找，在废弃的706工厂大楼里，但相信我，只要你们吃过一次，就一定会像我一样不惜步行两公里来到这里……","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1150229},{"step":59,"content":"你用余光偷偷观察伊格尼的反应，她竭力假装平静，但起伏的胸口和慌乱的眼神出卖了她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1150229},{"step":60,"speaker":"录音","content":"今天一定要给大家推荐这款冬日限定的冰淇淋，最适合在寒冷的天气里吃。它的外形设计非——常别致，用料上也非常考究……","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1150229},{"step":61,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"够了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1150231},{"step":62,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你……不许你再放了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1150231},{"step":63,"content":"伊格尼满脸通红，声音也抖得厉害。看来这账号确实是她的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1150226},{"step":64,"content":"你正要问她，却忽然听见啪的一声。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1150226},{"step":65,"content":"通讯终端冒出几缕青烟，自燃了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1150226},{"step":66,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"啊，糟了……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1150230},{"step":67,"content":"棚顶的应急消防装置随之哗啦哗啦地降下水流。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1150230},{"step":68,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我……我不是有意的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1150231},{"step":69,"content":"你赶忙操作设备停止降水，并从一旁的储物柜中拿出毛巾，擦干伊格尼被浇湿的头发和脸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1150231},{"step":70,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你不许再放了！不然我就……不然我就……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1150231},{"step":71,"content":"她好像还是想凶你，但那双噙着泪的眼睛却让她的威胁听起来几乎是可怜巴巴的哀求。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1150231},{"step":72,"content":"至此你确认了一件事——伊格尼在情绪激动时能力容易失控，而她会为此感到不安和愧疚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1150231},{"step":73,"content":"好了，我不会再放了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1150231},{"step":74,"content":"但是……你写得多好啊。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1150231},{"step":75,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"<size=25>写得好有什么用……</size>","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1150230},{"step":76,"options":["他们都说你很难相处","我看到了一个不一样的你"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201065,"trial_step":65,"course":3,"drawing":1150230,"choices":[{"text":"他们都说你很难相处","goto":66},{"text":"我看到了一个不一样的你","goto":73}]},{"step":77,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"反正……我这种禁闭者就是这样。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1150230},{"step":78,"content":"但我看到的伊格尼活泼开朗，乐于帮助别人，很受大家的欢迎。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1150226},{"step":79,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"那都是假的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1150230,"next":[69]},{"step":80,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"博客是我唯一可以像个正常人一样和别人交流的地方。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1150230},{"step":81,"content":"像个正常人一样？你很早就被发现是禁闭者了？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1150230},{"step":82,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"发现还是没发现又有什么区别？你们说得对，我是一个没有办法控制自己能力的废物。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1150230},{"step":83,"options":["我什么时候说过？","我可没说过"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"drawing":1150230,"choices":[{"text":"我什么时候说过？","goto":73},{"text":"我可没说过","goto":null}]},{"step":84,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我们这类禁闭者不都是这样的吗？总是连自己的能力都不能控制，总是会伤害其他人。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1150230},{"step":85,"content":"不会，在我这里不会。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1150230},{"step":86,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"哼。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1150231},{"step":87,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我才不信。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1150231},{"step":88,"content":"她隐藏不住任何情绪，尽管总是嘴硬地跟你抬杠，但她的眼神分明在说，真的吗？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1150229},{"step":89,"content":"所以……你平时一直都在努力控制自己的情绪么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1150229},{"step":90,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"没有，有仪器帮我。过了临界值就会报警。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1150229},{"step":91,"content":"你父母没帮过你？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1150229},{"step":92,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……帮过，但不是在这件事上。他们只是不想让我的真实身份被别人发现。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1150229},{"step":93,"content":"如果被发现了，会怎样？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1150229},{"step":94,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1150230},{"step":95,"content":"她张了张嘴，最终紧紧抿住，没有回答。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1150230},{"step":96,"content":"问出这个问题的时候，你便已经隐约猜到了答案。就在博客被封停之前，美食节的前一天晚上，伊格尼的博客上有一些疯狂粉丝的留言，声称他们发现了博主的真实身份。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1150230},{"step":97,"options":["有人找到你了？","那时候发生了什么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201086,"trial_step":86,"course":3,"drawing":1150230,"choices":[{"text":"有人找到你了？","goto":87},{"text":"那时候发生了什么？","goto":null}]},{"step":98,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我那天在家里，发了一条带着自己定位的博客。早上餐厅里忙完后，我正打算洗澡，他们就闯了进来……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1150230},{"step":99,"content":"他们惊吓了你，让你的能力失控，引发了大火，但这不是你希望的，对吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1150230},{"step":100,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"…………","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1150230},{"step":101,"content":"伊格尼没有再否认，只是红着眼低下了头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1150230},{"step":102,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"都怪我，是我太贪心。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1150230},{"step":103,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"早知道会这样……我就不应该写这个该死的博客。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1150230},{"step":104,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我的生活已经够幸福了，我应该知足，不该再做这些带来麻烦的事。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1150230},{"step":105,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我做过的，我都负责了。也没什么可再跟你说的了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1150230},{"step":106,"content":"她到底是在恐惧什么呢？是害怕“人”么？应该不是。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1150230},{"step":107,"content":"她把自己关在家里，不跟其他人交流，并不是因为恐惧他们，而是恐惧自己会伤害他人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1150230},{"step":108,"options":["这不是你的错"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201097,"trial_step":97,"course":3,"drawing":1150230,"choices":[{"text":"这不是你的错","goto":98}]},{"step":109,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"那又是谁的错呢？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1150230},{"step":110,"content":"有的事就是不能归咎于某个人的，硬要说的话……那些惊吓你的人也比你更应该被谴责，你也是受害者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1150230},{"step":111,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"有什么用？发生了就是发生了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1150230},{"step":112,"content":"你已经做了很多足以弥补这些的事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1150230},{"step":113,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"不，我永远也没有办法弥补的。我早就该自首了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1150230},{"step":114,"content":"早就该自首了？你开始反复咀嚼这句话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1150230},{"step":115,"content":"如果从六岁开始能力就一直不受控制，那她又是如何安然躲藏到了十六岁而不为人所知？要知道在新城这样的地方，有关禁闭者的任何一点风吹草动，都会引发人们的恐慌。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1150230},{"step":116,"content":"你想起了她先前那风轻云淡的一句话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1150230},{"step":117,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"帮过……但不是在这件事上。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1150230},{"step":118,"content":"你连忙拿出先前的材料进行查阅。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1150229},{"step":119,"content":"测试全屏类文本对演出效果的支持","style":14,"background":50409,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":108,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":120,"content":"转场…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":108,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":121,"content":"音效及语音…………………………………………………………………………","voice":["vo_cgplot_100002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":108,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":122,"content":"一次性特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":108,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":123,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":108,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":124,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":108,"course":6,"drawing":1150229},{"step":125,"content":"“涉事人员为禁闭者，其有条件主动接受MBCC管控。美食节现场人数1681人，受伤5人，现汇报数据应为总人数1679人，受伤人数5人，其中有2人失踪。”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1150229},{"step":126,"content":"而这两人迄今为止，仍未寻获。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1150229},{"step":127,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你想说什么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1150229},{"step":128,"content":"有两个人当时失踪了，而且和你有关。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1150229},{"step":129,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……关我什么事。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1150228},{"step":130,"content":"话在嘴边，你不知道该不该说。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1150228},{"step":131,"content":"但为了弄明白伊格尼的自首理由，你还是决定问出来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1150228},{"step":132,"options":["那两个人是你的父母么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201116,"trial_step":116,"course":3,"drawing":1150228,"choices":[{"text":"那两个人是你的父母么？","goto":117}]},{"step":133,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我听不懂你在说什么！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1150227},{"step":134,"content":"她一下子紧绷起来，神色慌乱，露出前所未有的恐惧与惊慌。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1150227},{"step":135,"options":["他们在哪？"],"style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201119,"trial_step":119,"course":3,"drawing":1150227,"choices":[{"text":"他们在哪？","goto":120}]},{"step":136,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"不……我不知道，不知道！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1150227},{"step":137,"content":"审查室的温度正在急剧上升，伊格尼的情绪波动显然又开始了。或许你不该问这样的问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1150227},{"step":138,"content":"可……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1150227},{"step":139,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"够了！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1150227},{"step":140,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"和我的父母无关！他们很好，那些都是我自己犯下的错！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1150227},{"step":141,"content":"她狠狠瞪着你，目光中燃烧着怒火。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1150227},{"step":142,"content":"审查室四周的墙角发出轻微的哔剥声，那些年久失修的老电路耐不住高温，冒出了火花。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1150227},{"step":143,"content":"你只好联络夜莺，让她带伊格尼回去休息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1150227},{"step":144,"content":"可你心中那令人不安的猜想却挥之不去……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":250201128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1150227}]}